# ========================================
# Files That Must Be Committed (negation patterns)
# ========================================

# Frontend files must be committed
!frontend/
!frontend/class-article.html
!frontend/styles/
!frontend/styles/article.css
!frontend/marking_statistics*.csv
!frontend/highlight_stats.json
!frontend/*.txt

# Documentation and configuration must be committed
!*.md
!*.sh
!.gitignore
!.claude/

# ========================================
# Comments and Notes
# ========================================
#
# This .gitignore file is for the highlight_words_display project.
# This is a pure frontend project (HTML + CSS + JavaScript).
#
# Main coverage areas:
# 1. Operating system files (macOS, Windows, Linux)
# 2. IDE and editor temporary files
# 3. Development dependencies (if extended in the future)
# 4. Sensitive information (keys, passwords, API keys)
# 5. Logs and cache files
#
# Files that should always be committed:
# - frontend/ directory with source code
# - *.md documentation files
# - *.sh deployment scripts
# - .gitignore itself
